/*
  SpeedHeatmapWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0094 · SpeedHeatmapWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `SpeedHeatmapWidget` resolves (table "SpeedHeatmapWidget") lives here with its
  web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first block holds the nine keys extracted verbatim from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/SpeedHeatmapWidget.tsx). The remaining keys back
  the registry metadata + the native chrome (freshness chip, refresh/retry/open,
  loading/error/banner copy, accessibility). The `{{count}}` / `{{speed}}` /
  `{{unit}}` interpolations become printf specifiers (%lld / %1$@ / %2$@).
*/

